* AM-02.3 stage S4 standalone
VCCX vcc 0 DC 5
VS in0 0 DC 0 AC 1
* --- S4: cascode (CE + grounded-base) + shunt-fed tank + capacitive tap
CIN2 in0 ba 1e-07
RBAT vcc ba 2200
RBAB ba 0 1500
QA ca1 ba ea 2N3904
RAX ea ex 5
REA ex 0 100
CEA ex 0 1e-09
Q2 ca xb ca1 2N3904
RBX1 vcc xb 10000
RBX2 xb 0 10000
CBX xb 0 1e-07
LTANK vcc ca 8.2e-07
CT1 ca rl 1.5e-11
CT2 rl 0 3.3e-11
RLD rl 0 50
CLD rl 0 1e-11
.model 2N3904 NPN(Is=6.734f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=74.03 Bf=416.4 Ne=1.259
+ Ise=6.734f Ikf=66.78m Xtb=1.5 Br=.7371 Nc=2 Isc=0 Ikr=0 Rc=1
+ Cjc=3.638p Mjc=.3085 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=4.493p Mje=.2593 Vje=.75
+ Tr=239.5n Tf=301.2p Itf=.4 Vtf=4 Xtf=2 Rb=10)
.options method=trap maxord=2 reltol=1e-4 trtol=7 temp=27 tnom=27
.control
set num_threads=1
set filetype=binary
op
ac dec 80 5meg 120meg
write tune_L0p82_C115_C233.raw
quit
.endc
.end
